      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The need for control when the world is unpredictable is a deeply human response, and that urge for agency is very powerful. It's natural to seek a peaceful way to regain some sense of command over your own experience. If the world outside is uncontrollable, finding a quiet way to manage your inner peace is something worth exploring. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line; they are trained to understand this exact feeling of needing control.",
